Source common.tape
Output out/step-2-choose-model.gif
Set Height 620
Hide
Type "cd $LC_DEMO_PROJECT; clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "localcode"
Enter
Sleep 9s
Show
Sleep 1.5s
Down
Sleep 900ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
Down
Sleep 900ms
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 6s
Hide
Ctrl+C
Sleep 500ms
Type "/exit"
Enter
Sleep 2s
